  <entity00155319:PrincipalPaymentMethodExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1) 만기상환 : 만기까지 조기상환되거나 교환권을 행사하지 않은 잔존 사채원리금에 대해 만기 일시상환2) 조기상환 : 회사의 조기상환권(Call Option) 및 사채권자의 조기상환권(Put Option) 존재</entity00155319:PrincipalPaymentMethodExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00155319:ExchangeSubjectExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">포스코홀딩스 주식회사 발행 기명식 보통 주식(자기주식)</entity00155319:ExchangeSubjectExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00155319:ExchangePriceAdjustmentExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무상증자, 주식분할, 주식병합, 주식의 종류 변경, 주주에 대한 옵션 또는 워런트의 발행, 주식배당, 현금배당,시가미만 신주 발행 등 교환가액 조정사유 발생시 사채조건에서 정한 바에 따라 조정</entity00155319:ExchangePriceAdjustmentExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfDetailsOfBreachesWhichPermittedLenderToDemandAcceleratedRepaymentDuringPeriodOfPrincipalInterestSinkingFundOrRedemptionTermsOfLoansPayable contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">- 당사의 지배권 변동(Change of control)이 발생하는 경우- 당사 발행주식이 상장폐지 (또는 30연속 거래일 이상 거래정지) 되는 경우</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfDetailsOfBreachesWhichPermittedLenderToDemandAcceleratedRepaymentDuringPeriodOfPrincipalInterestSinkingFundOrRedemptionTermsOfLoansPayable>
  <entity00155319:DescriptionOfExchangePriceOfExchangeableBondsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기 중 현금배당으로 인해 교환가액이 변경되었습니다.</entity00155319:DescriptionOfExchangePriceOfExchangeableBondsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00155319:DescriptionOfTheExchangeableBonds contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 싱가포르 증권거래소에 상장된 교환사채를 당기손익-공정가치 측정 금융부채로 지정하였습니다. 공정가치 평가는 공시되는 거래가격을 이용하고 있으며, 공정가치의 변동을 당기손익으로 인식하였습니다.</entity00155319:DescriptionOfTheExchangeableBonds>
  <entity00155319:BorrowingsIssueDateOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_NonCurrentPortionOfNonCurrentLoansReceivedExportImportBankOfKoreaAndOthersMemberOfLongTermBorrowingsMemberOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember" xml:lang="ko">2001년 9월</entity00155319:BorrowingsIssueDateOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsTableOfItems>
  <entity00155319:BorrowingsIssueDateOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_BondsIssuedKbSecuritiesCoLtdAndOthersMemberOfLongTermBorrowingsMemberOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsTableOfMember_ifrs-full_RangeAxis_ifrs-full_BottomOfRangeMember" xml:lang="ko">2019년 7월</entity00155319:BorrowingsIssueDateOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfDetailedInformationAboutLongTermBorrowingsTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfBasisOfInputsAndAssumptionsAndEstimationTechniquesUsedToMeasure12monthAndLifetimeExpectedCreditLosses contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_ifrs-full_AccumulatedImpairmentMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 매출채권 및 기타채권에 대해 과거 신용손실 경험과 연체상태를 기초로 채무불이행율을 추정하여 기대신용손실을 평가하고 있으며, 부문별 신용위험의 변동을 반영하기 위해 신용부도스왑(CDS) 프리미엄을 고려하고 있습니다. 신용이 손상된 자산, 신용위험이 유의적으로 증가한 중요채권 및 일부 기타채권의 경우 개별적으로 신용손실을 평가하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfBasisOfInputsAndAssumptionsAndEstimationTechniquesUsedToMeasure12monthAndLifetimeExpectedCreditLosses>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfBasisOfInputsAndAssumptionsAndEstimationTechniquesUsedToMeasure12monthAndLifetimeExpectedCreditLosses contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_ifrs-full_AccumulatedImpairmentMember" xml:lang="ko">연결실체는 매출채권 및 기타채권에 대해 과거 신용손실 경험과 연체상태를 기초로 채무불이행율을 추정하여 기대신용손실을 평가하고 있으며, 부문별 신용위험의 변동을 반영하기 위해 신용부도스왑(CDS) 프리미엄을 고려하고 있습니다. 신용이 손상된 자산, 신용위험이 유의적으로 증가한 중요채권 및 일부 기타채권의 경우 개별적으로 신용손실을 평가하고 있습니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfBasisOfInputsAndAssumptionsAndEstimationTechniquesUsedToMeasure12monthAndLifetimeExpectedCreditLosses>
