  <entity00155319:BorrowingsSuccessfulLoanForeignCurrencyLongTermBorrowingAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00155319_SuccessfulLoanForeignCurrencyLongTermBorrowingAgreementPoscoHoldingsCoLtdOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="2">1.02</entity00155319:BorrowingsSuccessfulLoanForeignCurrencyLongTermBorrowingAgreementOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfItems>
  <entity00155319:TotalAgreementAmountForeignCurrencyOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00155319_SuccessfulLoanForeignCurrencyLongTermBorrowingAgreementPoscoHoldingsCoLtdOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="2">1.05</entity00155319:TotalAgreementAmountForeignCurrencyOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfItems>
  <dart:DescriptionOfCommitments contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00155319_SuccessfulLoanForeignCurrencyLongTermBorrowingAgreementPoscoHoldingsCoLtdOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfCommitmentsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기말 현재 당사는 한국에너지공단과 서페르가나-취나바드 광구유가스전 탐사와 관련하여 USD 1.05백만 한도의 성공불융자 외화 장기차입약정을 체결하고 있습니다. 상기 차입금은 광구탐사 실패 시 융자원리금의 전부 또는 일부를 감면받게 되며, 성공 시 사업수익금 중 일정금액의 특별부담금을 부담하도록 약정하고 있습니다.당기말 현재 당사의 차입금 잔액은 USD 1.02백만입니다.</dart:DescriptionOfCommitments>
  <entity00155319:DescriptionOfKeyManagementPersonnel contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">상기의 주요 경영진에는 회사 활동의 계획, 운영, 통제에 대한 중요한 권한 및 책임을가진 이사(사외이사 포함) 및 집행임원 등이 포함되어 있습니다.</entity00155319:DescriptionOfKeyManagementPersonnel>
