  <entity00155319:DescriptionOfTheExchangeableBonds contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 싱가포르 증권거래소에 상장된 교환사채를 당기손익-공정가치 측정 금융부채로 지정하였습니다. 공정가치 평가는 공시되는 거래가격을 이용하고 있으며, 공정가치의 변동을 당기손익으로 인식하였습니다.</entity00155319:DescriptionOfTheExchangeableBonds>
  <entity00155319:DescriptionOfExchangePriceOfExchangeableBondsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당기 중 현금배당으로 인해 교환가액이 변경되었습니다.</entity00155319:DescriptionOfExchangePriceOfExchangeableBondsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfDetailsOfBreachesWhichPermittedLenderToDemandAcceleratedRepaymentDuringPeriodOfPrincipalInterestSinkingFundOrRedemptionTermsOfLoansPayable contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">- 당사의 지배권 변동(Change of control)이 발생하는 경우- 당사 발행주식이 상장폐지 (또는 30연속 거래일 이상 거래정지) 되는 경우</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfDetailsOfBreachesWhichPermittedLenderToDemandAcceleratedRepaymentDuringPeriodOfPrincipalInterestSinkingFundOrRedemptionTermsOfLoansPayable>
  <entity00155319:ExchangePriceAdjustmentExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00155319_GlobalBondsInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">무상증자, 주식분할, 주식병합, 주식의 종류 변경, 주주에 대한 옵션 또는 워런트의 발행, 주식배당, 현금배당,시가미만 신주 발행 등 교환가액 조정사유 발생시 사채조건에서 정한 바에 따라 조정</entity00155319:ExchangePriceAdjustmentExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondLineItemsOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
