  <entity00155319:CapitalContributionInForeignCurrencyOfDisclosureOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity00155319_CapitalContributionMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" unitRef="USD" decimals="-6">582000000</entity00155319:CapitalContributionInForeignCurrencyOfDisclosureOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity00155319_CapitalContributionMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사의 종속회사인 ㈜포스코는 북미 철강시장 대응 및 친환경 자동차강판 기반 확보를 위해 현대차그룹과 미국 루이지애나주에 전기로 일관제철소를 공동 건설하기위한 투자에 참여하였습니다. 당사가 100% 지분출자를 통해 SPC(POS-Louisiana   Inc.)를 설립 후 해당 SPC가 HYUNDAI-POSCO Louisiana Steel LLC의 20% 지분을 투자하는 구조이며,당사의 최종 출자금액은 약 U$582백만입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod>
  <entity00155319:ExpectedTreasuryStockCancellationOfDisclosureOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity00155319_CancellationOfTreasurySharesMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" unitRef="SHARES" decimals="INF">1691425</entity00155319:ExpectedTreasuryStockCancellationOfDisclosureOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity00155319_CancellationOfTreasurySharesMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">당사는 2026년 2월 19일 이사회 결의에 따라 기취득 자기주식 1,691,425주(소각예정금액 : 6,351억원)에 대한 소각을 결정하였습니다. 소각 예정일은 2026년 3월 31일입니다.</ifrs-full:DescriptionOfNatureOfNonadjustingEventAfterReportingPeriod>
  <entity00155319:BoardResolutionDateOfDisclosureOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_NonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodAxis_entity00155319_IssuanceOfForeignBondsMemberOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodMemberOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2026-01-12</entity00155319:BoardResolutionDateOfDisclosureOfNonAdjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodLineItemsOfDisclosureOfNonadjustingEventsAfterReportingPeriodTableOfItems>
